 <h2 id="duke-credit-for-businesses">Duke credit for businesses</h2>
 <p>Duke Energy Carolinas also offers the Charger Prep Credit to non-residential customers in South Carolina. Business customers apply directly. There's no contractor discount option, and the application needs a Customer Usage Profile form. The tariff caps the credit per charger by type. For example, a public Level 2 charger is capped at $1,054 and a workplace Level 2 charger at $793 (amounts based on rates effective April 1, 2023). See the <a href="guides/duke-energy-charger-prep-credit-sc.html">Duke credit guide</a> for details.</p>
