 <h2 id="check-before-you-hire">Check before you hire</h2>
 <p>We show license numbers as businesses publish them and check what we can, but information changes. Before you hire anyone, confirm their license with the South Carolina Department of Labor, Licensing and Regulation, ask for proof of insurance, and make sure they'll pull a permit.</p>
 <h2 id="ratings-and-reviews">Ratings and reviews</h2>
-<p>Ratings shown come from third-party sites such as Google, Thumbtack and HomeAdvisor, as of the date listed. They're for reference only and may have changed.</p>
+<p>Ratings shown come from Google, as of the date listed. They're for reference only and may have changed.</p>
 <h2 id="incentives-and-rules">Incentives and rules</h2>
 <p>Information about Duke Energy's Charger Prep Credit, permits and tax credits is a general summary as of the date shown on each page. Program terms can change. Confirm with Duke Energy, your utility, your permit office or a tax professional before relying on it. Nothing on this site is legal, tax or electrical advice.</p>
