 <p>Easley is across the county line in Pickens County, and it runs its own utility. Most homes in the city get electricity from Easley Combined Utilities (ECU), so Duke's credit doesn't apply to them. Fewer installers list Easley by name than Greenville-area towns, so this page shows both the ones that name Easley and the ones that cover the whole Upstate.</p>
