 <h2 id="what-to-check-before-you-call">What to check before you call</h2>
 <ol><li>Is the breaker for the charger tripped?</li><li>Does the charger's app or light show a fault code? Write it down.</li><li>For a plug-in charger, is the plug or outlet warm, scorched or loose? If so, stop using it and call an electrician.</li><li>Is the charger still under the maker's warranty? Many brands want you to contact them first.</li></ol>
