 <div class="wrap content"><h1>NEMA 14-50 Outlet Installers in Greenville, SC</h1>
 <p>A NEMA 14-50 is a 240-volt, 50-amp outlet. It's the plug most portable EV chargers and many plug-in wall chargers use. It's a good choice if you want to take the charger with you when you move, or if you're not sure which charger you'll end up with.</p>
